WEBVTT

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:14.210
"Check out your fortune!"

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:17.300
"Please answer the following question:"

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:21.130
"Right now, do you feel at 
the top of your game?" Yes!

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:22.790
No.

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:26.930
"Do you have a talent that 
nobody else can beat?" Yes!

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:28.900
No...

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.450
"Do you have confidence in yourself?" Yes!

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:34.510
No...

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:38.610
Congratulations, me! I'm in 
first place for good luck today!

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:41.470
Aichi, it says you're the lowest.

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:46.630
You sure are gloomy, even though the 
elimination round's been over for a week now.

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:51.080
Cheer up, for cryin' out 
loud! It's summer vacation!

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:54.880
But it's my fault that...

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:03.010
What a waste! Right?

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:09.930
The finals are starting!

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:11.860
Come on, Aichi, let's go!

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:13.120
Um...

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:15.370
Just come on!

00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:18.240
Let's make a maximum dash to Card Capital!

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:54.510
We made it in time!

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:56.230
Aichi...

00:02:57.900 --> 00:02:59.460
Misaki...

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:07.770
Hey, aren't you ready yet?

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:10.960
Didn't the manager say we'd 
watch the finals here?

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:12.850
It's already started!

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:20.860
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:25.430
I-It's because this is so heavy...

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:27.950
Want me to buy some spectator snacks?

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:30.250
I'll have an orange juice and potato chips.

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:31.400
Actually...

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:33.440
Food and drinks aren't allowed in the store.

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:35.570
Sorry...

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:40.530
No one's going to offer to help me here?!

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:46.700
S-Sub-Manager!

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:49.780
I appreciate that you want 
to give me a hand, but...

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:52.150
No thanks!

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:53.670
Hi there!

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:55.320
HT, yo!

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:57.790
Kamui, good timing!

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:00.330
Watch out!

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:03.040
K-Kamui...

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:05.160
H-Hi...

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:08.310
Thank you! I appreciate the save.

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:11.980
No prob. I didn't do anything...

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:15.200
Well, you're on the meek side today.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:16.740
Y-Yeah, well...

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:17.930
Kamui...

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:19.460
Brother!

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:21.130
Look out!

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:24.990
That was close!

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:26.520
Is the TV okay?

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:29.780
Good question. If we can just get the TV...

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:31.280
That was too close...

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:33.090
TC, TC, TC...

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:36.420
Sub-Manager...

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:41.420
Blaster of Darkness

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:45.660
Switch on!

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:48.610
It's on!

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:50.480
Turn up the volume!

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:51.370
Right!

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:56.470
National Vanguard Championship Finals!

00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:58.710
At last, the final battle!

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:00.760
I'm so excited!

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:04.740
The final battle?! Then the 
first two matches are over?

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:07.380
Looks like they're all done...

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:08.830
AD, yo!

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:12.320
This is a question of responsibility.

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:14.040
Manager, commit hara-kiri!

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:19.080
Even though it's my TV, 
everyone's piling on...

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:21.320
Hang in there, me!

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:25.370
With this last match, the country's 
Cardfighter champions will be decided!

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:29.940
That's right! You're all witnesses 
to history in the making!

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:34.460
Come on, Fighters!

00:05:34.460 --> 00:05:37.500
From Team Caesar, Kenji Mitsusada!

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:42.660
Mitsusada!

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:44.280
Mitsusada!

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:48.200
Everyone's totally pumped up...

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:50.030
Well, it is the final match.

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:51.880
Kenji Mitsusada...

00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:56.800
I'm the leader of Team 
Caesar, Kenji Mitsusada.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:03.130
Until just a while ago, we 
were there, too, weren't we?

00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:05.590
Brother...

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:10.060
Okay, okay...

00:06:10.060 --> 00:06:15.180
I think it's fantastic that you even made 
it to the nationals your first time out.

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:21.060
Yeah! It's a big deal that you guys 
got as far as you did without me.

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:25.440
Morikawa, are you trying 
to cheer everyone up?

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:32.300
Kourin, you're here today, too?!

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:33.450
Darn it!

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:37.410
If you guys had won, we 
could be there right now...

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:39.950
Idiots!

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:40.940
Idiot...

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:43.600
Why'd you lose?! That was too fast!

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:45.450
What up?!

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:46.620
Welcome.

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:48.130
Miwa...

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:51.740
Yep, just me. Too bad.

00:06:52.130 --> 00:06:54.990
Kai really must be mad.

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:57.360
After all, it's my fault...

00:06:57.770 --> 00:06:59.090
You got it wrong.

00:06:59.970 --> 00:07:01.510
Question:

00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:05.190
Do you think he's the kinda guy who 
would watch matches on TV with everyone?

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:08.730
I'm one hundred percent sure he's not.

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:10.500
OHP, yo!

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:11.730
No way!

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:12.950
I can't picture it!

00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:15.580
Yeah, right?

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:18.300
And his opponent, from Team Foo Fighter...

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:19.910
AL4!

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:24.140
Ren...

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:34.960
Ren...

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:42.300
Dr. O, what exactly should 
we be looking for here?

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:44.150
There's plenty to look for!

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:48.060
After all, it's a fight between the 
captains of last year's championship team

00:07:48.060 --> 00:07:50.100
and the championship team from two years ago.

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:52.180
In the regionals and here at nationals,

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:54.750
both fighters have won one victory after 
another with their overwhelming strength.

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:57.100
They are truly fated rivals!

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:58.690
Cardfighters all across the country

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:03.090
have been waiting for this 
moment, this clash of titans!

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:13.560
What, all the teams they've 
fought against get ignored?!

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:16.620
Who cares about the losers?

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:17.820
What?!

00:08:17.820 --> 00:08:20.110
...is what that one guy would say.

00:08:20.110 --> 00:08:22.790
Yeah, I'm 100% sure of that.

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:25.680
He's not there...

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:28.070
You're right!

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:31.340
That Kyou guy Ren fought isn't there!

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:35.280
The Great Kyou rides!

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:36.780
I attack with Nehalem!

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:40.460
D-Don't tell me... I'm going to lose?!

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:46.680
Maybe he switched with Ren 
after losing to Kai...

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:49.340
Caesar...

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:51.990
Isn't that the name of the Roman emperor?

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:54.400
You know of him?

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:58.310
Caesar... Genghis Khan... Napoleon...

00:08:58.660 --> 00:09:03.010
Very nice... Champions crowned with glory...

00:09:03.010 --> 00:09:04.510
That's right.

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:08.090
It seems that as rivals, we could 
have an entertaining conversation.

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:11.460
Rival? You?

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:14.600
Oh, I get it.

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:18.070
You want to make me mad so we 
can have a serious fight, right?

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:23.100
But you don't have to bother, since 
I always go all out when I fight!

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:26.940
Let's just leave it at that.

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:36.030
Begin the match!

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:40.340
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:40.340
Stand up the Vanguard!

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:03.870
Mitsusada attacks first!

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:06.270
Oh! Ren skillfully guards!

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:08.810
And now Ren counterattacks!

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:10.750
It's a blistering attack!

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:17.100
I guard with Karenroid, Daisy!

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:22.210
Just managed to protect myself that time...

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:25.320
I'd better hurry up and turn the tide here!

00:10:26.510 --> 00:10:27.990
Turn end.

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:31.600
My turn! I stand and draw!

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:34.250
Looks like the emperor is losing ground...

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:34.930
Yeah...

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.010
I call Masked Police, Grander!

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:45.380
Up to now, it's been a battle in which 
neither fighter has yielded an inch!

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:49.970
It's an interesting match-up, just right for 
the final fight of the national tournament!

00:10:50.310 --> 00:10:52.320
These two are too strong!

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:53.840
TS, yo!

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:55.430
It's true...

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:57.720
They're not bad...

00:10:58.100 --> 00:11:00.400
For sure, it is a great fight, but...

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:01.610
Brother?

00:11:02.530 --> 00:11:05.620
It feels like Ren isn't serious.

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:13.220
Is this the best you can do?

00:11:13.220 --> 00:11:15.290
All right then, it's my turn.

00:11:15.290 --> 00:11:17.050
I stand and draw.

00:11:19.930 --> 00:11:22.400
Well, it is the final match...

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:24.700
I'll give you a treat 
by letting you see this.

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:29.850
Just a little bit of me when I'm serious...

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:34.420
Champions crowned with glory...

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:38.570
However, there was something that 
even they were no match for.

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:43.670
Where there is light, there is darkness...

00:11:43.670 --> 00:11:45.950
That's one of a pair of truths...

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:50.520
And light can only be 
swallowed up by darkness...

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.670
That's a truth, too!

00:11:58.540 --> 00:12:00.330
Appear from the everlasting darkness,

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:02.700
Dark Spirits!

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:04.050
I ride...

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:08.420
Blaster Dark!

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:14.110
I don't believe it!

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:16.670
What is that unit?!

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:19.020
It's not Blaster Blade?!

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:31.220
A black Blaster Blade...

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:55.940
What even champions couldn't overcome...

00:12:55.940 --> 00:12:57.730
Were you able to imagine what it is?

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:02.650
Was it difficult?

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:03.890
Or, perhaps...

00:13:05.370 --> 00:13:06.900
You can no longer hear me?

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:13.540
What kind of deck does he have?!

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:16.000
Very well. Final Turn.

00:13:21.370 --> 00:13:24.490
Farewell, Your Imperial Majesty.

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:43.600
T-The national champion!

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:47.110
Team Foo Fighter AL4!

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:54.490
Ooh, that was scary... A lopsided victory...

00:13:54.490 --> 00:13:56.270
Definitely one-sided...

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:59.070
Ren really is incredible...

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:04.480
All right, the victorious Ren 
Suzugamori of Foo Fighter AL4,

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:07.110
could you say a few words to 
Cardfighters across the nation?

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:09.160
Everyone was quite strong.

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:13.660
Please continue doing your best 
at wasting time and effort.

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.010
What?!

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:16.750
He's mocking everyone!

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:20.610
A-And how about a few words to 
the people you fought against...?

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:21.910
There's nothing to say.

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:25.470
O-Okay, then, what did you think 
about the tournament this year?

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:27.310
It was boring.

00:14:27.310 --> 00:14:28.660
Really?

00:14:28.660 --> 00:14:30.480
He's tickin' me off!

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:32.720
Amazing...

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:34.500
Foo Fighter?

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:39.070
Certainly, it is unusual to see such 
a pronounced difference in strength

00:14:39.070 --> 00:14:40.780
in a final match.

00:14:40.780 --> 00:14:43.120
No! I mean Kai!

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:46.410
He beat this team of monsters once!

00:14:47.100 --> 00:14:49.710
Overlord attacks your Devil Summoner!

00:14:49.710 --> 00:14:51.050
Drive check!

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:52.730
Eternal Flame!

00:14:54.680 --> 00:14:57.670
I hate to admit it, but... I have to.

00:14:57.670 --> 00:14:59.610
He's amazing!

00:14:59.610 --> 00:15:00.880
Kamui...

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:06.960
The winners, Team Foo Fighter AL4!

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.450
Wow...

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:13.060
This news is being shown 
all over the world, right?

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:16.190
They're big stars! BS, yo!

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:26.890
Kourin!

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:30.670
That bouquet should've gone to me!

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:35.050
Darn it! It's because Aichi 
lost that last match!

00:15:35.050 --> 00:15:36.870
I-I...

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:38.790
Cut it out, Lose-umi!

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:39.960
It's Katsumi!

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:42.250
It's not Brother's fault.

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:45.450
I'm the one who caused the 
team the biggest problem.

00:15:45.450 --> 00:15:47.780
Because I acted stupidly...

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:49.510
Kamui...

00:15:49.850 --> 00:15:51.160
What about me?

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:53.580
I lost to Asaka...

00:15:53.910 --> 00:15:56.300
There's no reason for you 
to shoulder the blame.

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:58.300
Misaki...

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:01.220
That's right. You did very well.

00:16:02.570 --> 00:16:03.680
Boring!

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:08.350
Hey, everyone! Don't look so gloomy!

00:16:09.090 --> 00:16:12.140
Why don't we all go to the beach?!

00:16:14.060 --> 00:16:15.850
Actually, this is...

00:16:15.850 --> 00:16:17.590
When summer comes, the beach is fun!

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:19.830
And going to the beach means swimming!

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:22.550
Camping! Fireworks! Summer vacation!

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:25.260
Sounds good. A diversion 
to change the mood, huh?

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:28.350
Right, Aichi? I'm sure it'll be fun...

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:34.040
Sorry!

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:35.390
Brother!

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:51.910
Suzugamori was awesome, ya know?

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:54.970
What was that card?! I've 
never seen it before!

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:58.350
There you are!

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:08.230
Miss, I'll have the seasonal fruit parfait!

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:10.060
You want one?

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:12.420
Why are you here?

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:18.410
Jeez. With a sour look like that, I bet 
the waitress doesn't even wanna come over.

00:17:19.460 --> 00:17:21.630
And that's the long and short of it.

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:26.190
Would you just say something to him?

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:28.190
It's nonsense.

00:17:29.030 --> 00:17:30.730
Yeah, I know...

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:33.010
But just a little...

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:35.930
A few words would be fine.

00:17:35.930 --> 00:17:37.500
He's a teammate, isn't he?

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:39.870
Like I care?

00:17:42.280 --> 00:17:43.930
Yeah, I know...

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:47.100
Uh-uh!

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:48.600
With this, we're even, okay?

00:17:57.840 --> 00:18:01.460
If he'll do it for a cup 
of coffee, I got off cheap.

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:07.130
Why, that dirty, rotten... He had lunch!

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:17.650
It's my fault.

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:40.580
Because I lost...

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:51.370
It's frustrating...

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:58.150
If I... If I could just 
have one more chance...

00:18:59.050 --> 00:18:59.930
But...

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:08.110
I spoiled Kai's win

00:19:08.110 --> 00:19:12.060
and Team Q4's chance at victory.

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:19.330
I can't stay in Team Q4 anymore.

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:26.120
Kai...

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:36.840
I'm sorry.

00:19:39.370 --> 00:19:42.140
It's my fault we lost...

00:19:43.020 --> 00:19:44.380
You're right.

00:19:45.150 --> 00:19:46.600
It's your fault.

00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:55.070
You can't beat them yet, 
not with your skill...

00:19:56.700 --> 00:19:57.520
I know.

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:00.220
Not yet...

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:02.130
Not yet?

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:06.060
You mean I can get stronger?

00:20:08.190 --> 00:20:09.310
Kai!

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:15.020
I'm gonna get stronger!

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:16.910
I swear I'll get stronger!

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:22.630
Thank you, Kai...

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:28.140
Say again?

00:20:28.510 --> 00:20:30.190
I want you to give me special training.

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:33.750
I-I want to get stronger...

00:20:34.020 --> 00:20:35.990
Aichi's all fired up!

00:20:35.990 --> 00:20:37.780
Well... It is hot outside...

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:39.420
Aichi...

00:20:39.850 --> 00:20:41.550
M-Me too!

00:20:42.480 --> 00:20:46.090
I wanna do special training, too! Next 
time, I promise I won't be a pain!

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:49.460
And I want our team to win next time!

00:20:49.460 --> 00:20:51.280
Your team...

00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:53.960
Are you sure, even with that guy?

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:57.580
He knows more about their 
amazing world than me...

00:20:57.580 --> 00:21:01.190
Much as I hate to admit it, I 
wanna know more about that world!

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:03.230
Kamui...

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:05.720
Shin, me too.

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:09.110
What I'm doing isn't working.

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:13.780
Putting together a deck, making the most of 
the units, staying a step ahead of the fight...

00:21:13.780 --> 00:21:15.500
There's a lot that I want to study.

00:21:22.100 --> 00:21:24.090
Is it... not okay...?

00:21:24.690 --> 00:21:28.040
Now these are the faces that I want to see.

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:31.230
For kids like you, boom!

00:21:31.230 --> 00:21:32.260
The beach!

00:21:33.360 --> 00:21:34.790
Shin...

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:38.740
Ah-ah-ah! Who said anything about slacking?

00:21:38.740 --> 00:21:40.940
This is a camp!

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:43.940
Team Q4's summer training camp!

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:45.950
Training camp...

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:48.670
That's our Manager! Let's do it!

00:21:48.670 --> 00:21:50.650
Right, Brother?!

00:21:50.650 --> 00:21:51.410
Yeah!

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:53.550
Oh yeah! I'm gonna swim!

00:21:53.550 --> 00:21:56.270
And what else goes with the beach?

00:21:56.270 --> 00:21:57.710
Fireworks!

00:21:57.710 --> 00:21:59.370
Ding-ding!

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:05.060
Appear from the everlasting 
darkness, Dark Spirits!

00:22:05.390 --> 00:22:06.450
I ride...

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:10.550
Blaster Dark!

00:22:13.760 --> 00:22:16.010
I'm gonna get strong!

00:23:51.060 --> 00:23:53.020
A black Blaster Blade...

00:23:53.020 --> 00:23:54.700
Uh, how can I put this...

00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:57.980
It's nobody's fault that you 
didn't make it to the finals,

00:23:57.980 --> 00:23:59.300
and I didn't get sweet time with Kourin...

00:23:59.300 --> 00:24:01.930
Hey, that's very mature of you, 
Morikawa. You've grown up some!

00:24:01.930 --> 00:24:05.190
Of course! Forget the 
past and now focus on...

00:24:05.190 --> 00:24:07.070
The beach! Swimsuits!

00:24:07.070 --> 00:24:08.710
And fireworks!

00:24:08.710 --> 00:24:11.580
That's right. We have to move 
on and keep going forward.

00:24:11.580 --> 00:24:14.990
Next time: It's Summer! 
It's Camp! It's Vanguard!

00:24:14.990 --> 00:24:17.850
Still, I can't picture a grown-up Morikawa...

00:24:17.850 --> 00:24:18.700
Same to you!
